#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <b>Inventory app</b> allows you to manage all of your stock operations, "
"including inputs, outputs, and internal movements. When you validate a "
"purchase or sales order, a corresponding receipt or delivery is "
"automatically created."
msgstr ""
"Met de <b>Voorraad-app</b> kun je al je voorraadactiviteiten beheren, "
"inclusief inkomende en uitgaande goederen en interne verplaatsingen. Wanneer "
"je een inkoop- of verkooporder valideert, wordt automatisch een bijbehorende "
"ontvangst of levering aangemaakt."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <b>PLM (Product Lifecycle Management) App</b> is your dedicated "
"environment for managing the evolution of your products. It allows you to "
"review and iterate on every Bill of Materials (BOM) update, ensuring that "
"all modifications are tracked and visible within a specialized application."
msgstr ""
"In de <b>PLM-app (Product Lifecycle Management)</b> beheer je de "
"ontwikkeling van je producten. Je kunt elke stuklijst-aanpassing bekijken en "
"herzien, zodat alle wijzigingen worden bijgehouden en zichtbaar zijn binnen "
"een gespecialiseerde applicatie."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <b>Project app</b> centralizes all the necessary information, ensuring a "
"smooth and perfectly managed follow-up process."
msgstr ""
"De <b>Project-app</b> centraliseert alle benodigde informatie en zorgt zo "
"voor een vlot en perfect beheerd opvolgingsproces."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The <b>Shopfloor App</b> serves as a direct bridge between production and "
"quality management, allowing workers to maintain high standards and suggest "
"improvements in real time."
msgstr ""
"De <b>Werkvloer-app</b> fungeert als een directe brug tussen productie en "
"kwaliteitsbeheer, waardoor werknemers hoge normen kunnen handhaven en "
"realtime verbeteringen kunnen voorstellen."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The Replenishment view gives you a clear overview of all current and future "
"needs (you can adjust the <b>Horizon settings</b> to see what's coming up). "
"From this screen, you can directly create purchase orders, subcontracting "
"orders, or\n"
"      manufacturing orders."
msgstr ""
"Het Aanvuldashboard geeft je een duidelijk beeld van alle huidige en "
"toekomstige behoeften (je kunt de instellingen voor <b>Horizon</b> aanpassen "
"om te zien wat er op komst is). Vanuit dit scherm kun je direct "
"inkooporders, uitbestedingsorders of productieorders aanmaken."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The Shopfloor App empowers workers to contribute to process optimization "
"through the <b>PLM (Product Lifecycle Management)</b> integration:"
msgstr ""
"Dankzij de Werkvloer-app kunnen werknemers mee processen optimaliseren via "
"de integratie van <b>PLM (Product Lifecycle Management)</b>:"

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The barcode app can be installed as a standalone application on devices. "
"This means people can use it without having access to the rest of the "
"database."
msgstr ""
"De barcode-app kan als zelfstandige applicatie op apparaten worden "
"geïnstalleerd. Dit betekent dat mensen deze kunnen gebruiken zonder toegang "
"te hebben tot de rest van de database."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid "The financial reporting."
msgstr "De financiële verslaglegging."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The system scales with your complexity. Explore our documentation to learn "
"more about:"
msgstr ""
"Het systeem kan aangepast worden aan de complexiteit van je workflows. "
"Bekijk onze documentatie voor meer informatie over:"

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This end-to-end solution is engineered to streamline complex lifecycles—from "
"Engineer-to-Order (ETO) and turnkey projects to high-stakes production. It "
"provides seamless oversight across:"
msgstr ""
"Deze complete oplossing is ontworpen om complexe productiecycli te "
"stroomlijnen, van Engineer-to-Order (ETO) en kant-en-klaarprojecten tot "
"risicovolle productie. Het biedt handig overzicht over:"

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This project structure offers <b>full flexibility</b> to adapt to your "
"unique workflow."
msgstr ""
"Deze <b>flexibele</b> projectstructuur kun je volledig aanpassen aan je aan "
"je unieke workflow."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model:project.project,name:custom_industrial_equipment.project_project_6
msgid "Timber Drag Chain System"
msgstr "Sleepkettingsysteem voor houttransport"

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid "Tips for success:"
msgstr "Tips voor succes:"

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"To create a new Bill of Materials from scratch, you'll need to know that "
"there are two distinct types: <b>Production BOMs</b> (for in-house "
"production) and <b>Subcontracting BOMs</b> (for external production). Each "
"type requires\n"
"      different settings. If you want to learn more about subcontracting, "
"feel free to explore our documentation. Odoo manages complex "
"subcontracting<b> </b>workflows, including component fulfillment, "
"dropshipping, real-time stock tracking, and much more."
msgstr ""
"Als je stuklijsten vanaf nul wilt opstellen, moet je eerst weten dat er twee "
"verschillende types bestaan: <b>Productiestuklijsten</b> (voor interne "
"productie) en <b>Uitbestedingsstuklijsten</b> (voor externe productie). Voor "
"elke type zijn er andere instellingen. Als je meer wilt ontdekken over "
"uitbesteding, kun je de documentatie raadplegen. Odoo ondersteunt complexe "
"uitbestedingsworkflows, inclusief component fulfillment, dropshipping, "
"realtime voorraadopvolging en nog veel meer."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model:project.task.type,name:custom_industrial_equipment.project_task_type_23
msgid "To do"
msgstr "Te doen"

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"To get a rapid understanding of the processes this Odoo package offers, you "
"can execute the following flows and configure the settings to suit your "
"business."
msgstr ""
"Om snel inzicht te krijgen in de processen die dit Odoo-pakket biedt, kun je "
"de volgende flows uitvoeren en de instellingen configureren die passen bij "
"jouw bedrijf."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid "To get started:"
msgstr "Om te beginnen:"

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"To plan your orders, go to the manufacturing app, select them, and click "
"\"Plan.\" The system will then generate a detailed schedule that accounts "
"for the capacity of your <b>work centers</b>. You can see a clear overview "
"of your schedule\n"
"      on the planning by work centers screen."
msgstr ""
"Om orders te plannen ga je naar de Productie-app. Selecteer de orders en "
"klik op 'Plannen'. Het systeem genereert vervolgens een gedetailleerd schema "
"dat rekening houdt met de capaciteit van je <b>werkplekken</b>. Je kunt een "
"duidelijk overzicht van je planning zien bij 'Planning per werkplek'."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.view_page_home
msgid "Turnkey solutions"
msgstr ""

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.view_page_home
msgid "Understanding your needs and production flow"
msgstr ""

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use <b>Unique Serial Numbers</b> to distinguish between identical products. "
"This is essential for accurate maintenance, ensuring that every service "
"action is recorded against the specific unit rather than the generic model."
msgstr ""
"Gebruik <b>unieke serienummers</b> om identieke producten te kunnen "
"onderscheiden. Dat is essentieel voor accuraat onderhoud waarbij elke "
"onderhoudsinterventie wordt geregistreerd op het specifieke serienummer in "
"plaats van gewoon op het algemene model."

#. module: custom_industrial_equipment
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_industrial_equipment.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use barcode scanners to validate stock movements, identify pallet positions, "
"and perform fast, accurate stock operations. Greatly improves warehouse "
"efficiency and reduces human error."
msgstr ""
"Gebruik barcodescanners om voorraadverplaatsingen te valideren, locaties van "
"palletten te vinden en snelle, nauwkeurige voorraadbewerkingen uit te "
"voeren. Dit maakt je magazijn efficiënter en vermindert het aantal "
